umulative proportion\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"the month and year of vaccination was imputed using the weighted sequential hot deck method\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Results were weighted and analyzed with statistical software to account for the complex survey design.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Groups with relatively low prevalence of ILI and relatively high sample sizes were used as reference categories for APRs.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}